"""
======================================================================
TRACEATLAS — EMAILINT
EMAIL HEADER / INFRASTRUCTURE / COMMUNICATION-EVIDENCE INTELLIGENCE AI EMPLOYEE
Python Implementation
======================================================================

Mode:
DEFENSIVE / AUTHORIZED / EVIDENCE-FIRST / PRIVACY-AWARE

Primary boundary:
Email intelligence and forensic communication analysis,
NOT phishing, account access, email spoofing or social engineering.
"""

