	by mx.google.com (Google) with SMTP id abc123;
	Mon, 09 Oct 2026 10:00:00 +0000 (UTC)
Received: from localhost (localhost [127.0.0.1])
	by mail.vendor-example.com (Postfix) with ESMTP id def456;
	Mon, 09 Oct 2026 09:59:00 +0000 (UTC)
From: "Vendor Finance Dept" <billing@vendor-example.com>
To: accounts.payable@company-target.com
Subject: URGENT: Updated Bank Details for Invoice #9981
Date: Mon, 09 Oct 2026 10:00:00 +0000
Message-ID: <20261009100000.12345@mail.vendor-example.com>
Authentication-Results: mx.google.com;
       spf=pass (google.com: domain of billing@vendor-example.com designates 192.0.2.1 as permitted sender) smtp.mailfrom=billing@vendor-example.com;
       dkim=pass header.i=@vendor-example.com header.s=default header.b=abc123xyz;
       dmarc=pass (p=NONE sp=NONE dis=NONE) header.from=vendor-example.com
MIME-Version: 1.0
