--frontier
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"

Hello Accounts Team,

Please note that our banking details have changed due to a merger. 
Kindly update your records for Invoice #9981.

New IBAN: GB12 XXXX 1234 5678 9012
New SWIFT: XXXXGB2L

Please process the pending payment to this new account immediately to avoid late fees.

Regards,
Finance Dept
Vendor Example Inc.
